<Slide style={{
    width: '1280px',
    height: '720px',
    background: '#0C0E14',
    padding: '0px 67px',
    fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei',
    position: 'relative',
    display: 'flex',
    flexDirection: 'column',
}}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: -70, right: -50, width: 420, height: 420, borderRadius: '50%', background: '#22D3EE', opacity: 0.06 }} />

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 38, position: 'relative', zIndex: 1 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#22D3EE', letterSpacing: 2 }}>01 · 平台架构</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 14, position: 'relative', zIndex: 1 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EAED', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>
            四层架构：把「判断过程」本身放进系统
        </Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 12, position: 'relative', zIndex: 1 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#A8AEBE', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            普通平台管数据（增删改查），本平台管裁决（怎么做有依据的决策）—— 四层里 L2 是灵魂。
        </Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 25, height: 1, width: '100%', background: '#2A3040', position: 'relative', zIndex: 1 }} />

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 26, height: 454, position: 'relative', zIndex: 1 }}>

        <Box style={{ width: 640, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
            <Box style={{
                flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 16,
                background: '#141922', border: '1px solid #2A3040', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 18px',
            }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 52, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#60667C' }}>L3</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EAED' }}>应用与场景层　交付形态</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#A8AEBE', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                        免代码门户 + 场景组合：客户用受控声明组装页面与场景，不写代码、不改内核。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{
                flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 16,
                background: '#1B2130', border: '1px solid #22D3EE', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 18px',
            }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 52, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#22D3EE' }}>L2</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#22D3EE' }}>决策智能内核　★ 最核心</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#A8AEBE', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                        知识 → 记忆 → 裁决 的单向证据管道：先有证据，再有上下文，最后才有可审计的裁决。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{
                flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 16,
                background: '#141922', border: '1px solid #2A3040', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 18px',
            }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 52, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#60667C' }}>L1</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EAED' }}>智能体团队　自进化引擎室</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#A8AEBE', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                        多智能体编排、复盘智能体、反馈闭环回接 —— 它们服务决策，不替代决策。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{
                flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 16,
                background: '#141922', border: '1px solid #2A3040', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 18px',
            }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 52, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#60667C' }}>L0</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EAED' }}>底座　可扩展性承诺</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#A8AEBE', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                        粒子契约、事件总线、审计链、统一存储（关系库 + 向量），领域取值全部由消费方注入。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{
            width: 480, background: '#141922', border: '1px solid #2A3040', borderRadius: 12,
            padding: '18px 22px', flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center',
        }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#22D3EE', letterSpacing: 1 }}>
                证据管道 · 单向 · 不可重排
            </Text>

            <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 96, marginTop: 14, background: '#1B2130', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid #2A3040', padding: '12px 16px', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EAED' }}>知识 K</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#A8AEBE', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    写库即构建：本体与向量随数据自生长，知识不用人工另建一套。
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <svg width={24} height={26} viewBox='0 0 24 26'>
                <path d='M12 0 L12 18' stroke='#22D3EE' strokeWidth='2' fill='none' />
                <polygon points='6,17 18,17 12,26' fill='#22D3EE' />
            </svg>

            <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 96, background: '#1B2130', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid #2A3040', padding: '12px 16px', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EAED' }}>记忆 M</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#A8AEBE', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    双轨记忆：事件流留住过程，结论留住判断，随时可寻址、可溯源。
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <svg width={24} height={26} viewBox='0 0 24 26'>
                <path d='M12 0 L12 18' stroke='#22D3EE' strokeWidth='2' fill='none' />
                <polygon points='6,17 18,17 12,26' fill='#22D3EE' />
            </svg>

            <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 96, background: '#1B2130', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid #22D3EE', padding: '12px 16px', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#22D3EE' }}>裁决 D</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#A8AEBE', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    证据齐备才放行：链末红线闸门把关，裁决带编号可回查、可复算。
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Text style={{ marginTop: 'auto', fontSize: 14, color: '#60667C', lineHeight: 1.5, textAlign: 'center' }}>
                顺序是契约第一等公民 —— 不得以「性能优化」为由重排。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', position: 'relative', zIndex: 1 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#60667C' }}>AI 原生决策智能平台 · 2026</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#60667C' }}>01 / 03</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
